      hu: ["Négy prefektúra területén fekszik", "Híres a mocsári kontyvirág virágzásáról", "Magában foglalja a Sibucu-hegyet", "2007-ben vált önálló nemzeti parkká"],
      ro: ["Se întinde pe teritoriul a patru prefecturi", "Faimos pentru înflorirea calelor de mlaștină", "Include muntele Shibutsu", "A devenit parc național independent în 2007"],
      en: ["Spans across four different prefectures", "Famous for the blooming of white skunk cabbage", "Includes the peak of Mount Shibutsu", "Became an independent national park in 2007"],
